BT /F1 8 Tf 0.07 0.09 0.12 rg 46 533 Td (  the game, management staff will not be involved into this.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.07 0.09 0.12 rg 46 521 Td (- If the student is called out for matches, and if he does not come without informing there will be a penalty of 500 and that) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.07 0.09 0.12 rg 46 511 Td (  match will be counted as present.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.07 0.09 0.12 rg 46 499 Td (- Parents are not allowed to be present during the session or matches, if you are present you should be 10 to 15 meters away) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.07 0.09 0.12 rg 46 489 Td (  from the tent or pavilion.) Tj ET
